<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials rallies from support.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials rallies from support.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------All Industrials---------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 4010 4050 4080 *RSI-14 69.35 *MA-10 3947.9 3925 - 4025  *Sup 3980 3960 3930 *MA-20 3939.9 *MA-40 3859.3 ---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 27-------------</p>
<p>*Rally continues</p>
<p>*Towards top of medium term bull channel</p>
<p>*Very overbought in medium and longer terms</p>
<p>*All Industrial Index closed at 4,007.2 on Monday.</p>
<p>The Australian All Industrials bounces from support and is higher again through the psychological 4,000 level.</p>
